&lt;p&gt;For example,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="$IMS-CC-FILEBASE$/assessment_questions/image.png?canvas_download=1" alt="image.png" loading="lazy"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
